<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">AFI - Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">Filipiɛ̃</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola baal a Filipese</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipiɛ̃</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filipese</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ákel ɔ̃nkaan wu ŋ'éli ndɛ onse bwal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:7">1.7</ref></char>). Ndɛ onge wu ákel ndɛ k'Efedze. Ndɛ ákel ndɛ sua mvel wu ãku-ãtaan y'ãsɛɛn (56) ye wu ãku-ãtaan ye nsiaan (57). Kɛn a ndɛ áli ye kaã li apal onse lɔ, me ndɔɔ yi asa kwɛn okiool b'Afilipiɛ̃ oyi nkwel bvool me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ akal y'esɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool áyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ol'Ebvɔɔn li ke bviil li Filipese li ébal ndɛ ŋ'éyɛn ndɛ dzwɛ e ndɛ li ontam li mbuaal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:11-40">Ɛ̃sa 16.11-40</ref></char>). Ebvɔɔn olɔ éli y'ondoo bibi ye ndɛ, bvool éwueel a ndɛ nsa bibi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ábiri ɔ̃nkaan wu Epafolodite, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ wu áyewa Pool ãkab m'éyuɔɔl Ebvɔɔn. Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, Pool abveel Ebvɔɔn ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a wuaal li eyɔɔ ndɛ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ awa bɔ ãnsia m'ola ndɛ. Ndɛ bvool awa bɔ mpɛn yi asɛn ãnã onse okiool. Ebvɔɔn olɔ onge li éli y'ɛ̃kɔɔl, ke ngwel wɛ Pool awa bɔ luo li akal m'ɔ̃dzi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu, akoo k'akab ndɛ m'ebaal etaan:</para>
  <para style="io1">Ãnsia m'ãtal ndyam wu Pool (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1.12-26</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Pool awa Ebvɔɔn luo li akal m'ɔ̃dzi y'okuaal o nzuru onge Mãsia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1.27–2.18</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Pool awa ãnsia m'ãtal Timote y'Epafolodite (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2.19-30</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Pool awa akiool ãnkunkwa me b'otal onkɔɔ b'Ayuda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3.1–4.9</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">Pool abveel Ebvɔɔn ãtuɛɛn bvool awa lɔ ɔ̃lɛɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-23">4.10-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, ndɔɔ yi nkiin eli okal y'esɛ. Kyɛ esuo obvel b'okiool nkal otaal.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool ye Timote b'asal a Yeso Mãsia, bee eyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ola baal bueel ba ngel onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Yeso-Mãsia, b'ali ke Filipese. Bee eyuɔɔl ndɛ hɛ̃ ol'ambiri y'ankiaal b'Ebvɔɔn. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ nyiĩ, awa byɛ opi!<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãbuɛɛn ã Pool me ndɔɔ akiool ba Filipese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Ãlio mbueel m'ebeteel mɛ̃ byɛ, mɛ̃ ebebveel Nziã a mɛ̃ ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Ãlio mbueel m'ebebuɛɛn mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a byɛ bueel, mɛ̃ ebebuɛɛn y'esɛ, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal wu esi byɛ ye bee m'otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ, bɛɛn tsoo li ɛ̃kwel tiil nonɔ̃ ŋã. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Taa-taa, mɛ̃ nkiool bam wɛn, wu abɛɛn ɔ̃sal wa ngesɛ wu onse byɛ, anɔɔn a ndɛ tiil k'efa ndɛ me tsoo li oya o Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Eli bam ngesɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal y'ãtsam m'obobɔ me ndɔɔ a byɛ bueel. Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ eli onse ɔ̃kwal a mɛ̃, nzal-a-ŋɛn, byɛ bueel ebɔɔ nyiĩ yi esio Nziã mɛ̃, ekal ŋe ndi mɛ̃ me bwal ŋã, ekal ŋ'etsuun mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ, wuo ekal ŋ'esuo mɛ̃ otaa-taa o yɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã ndyam oyɛɛ kwɛn, mɛ̃ ndi y'ɔ̃tio a byɛ bueel me dzii e Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ndɔɔ yi esɔɔ mɛ̃ onse ãbuɛɛn ã mɛ̃, yɛn, dzii e byɛ eyi nkwel onse oyɛɛ b'ãndɔɔ ngesɛ y'ãyal mbueel, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />kwɛn byɛ ekoo k'ebwɛɛl ãndɔɔ mã y'ɔ̃bvɛn. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ekieel ekal tsɛ-tsɛ bvool eywɛn elyal me tsoo li oya o Mãsia. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Yeso Mãsia kieel asa kwɛn omwiĩ o byɛ oluul m'ãndɔɔ mã dzu, m'ãwa Nziã dzuun ye lweel.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyi o Nsia yi Ngesɛ nkwel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãyi me mɛ̃ ãsi kwɛn Nsia yi Ngesɛ eyi nkwel. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal a nzɔ a ɔ̃kwɛn ye b'asiil bueel ayɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃ ndi me bwal me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal a Mãsia. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Bvool okuru b'akuru mɛ̃ me bwal owi andoo bibi mpɛn onse Mfam, me ndɔɔ yi atee Endɔɔ e Nziã y'ãŋã, buɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Taa-taa, baal bakyɛ abetee Mãsia me nzal a obɔɔ ye nzal a obel, kɛn a bakyɛ abetee ndɛ m'ãtsam mã ngesɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Baal b'abetee m'ãtsam mã ngesɛ obɔ, b'asal me dzii. Bɔ ayɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃ ndi ŋã onse bwal me ndɔɔ yi etsweel Nsia yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Kɛn a baal bakyɛ abetee Mãsia me nzal a obel, ãtsam ã bɔ k'ãli dzu wɛ. Bɔ adzii k'akool fool e mɛ̃ li mbuul a bwal.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ãtsam ã bɔ ãkal mã mfy-mfya wuo mã taa-taa, ndɔɔ pyɛ! Ki nguo kyɛn, abetee Mãsia. Mɛ̃ esia mpaa me ndɔɔ oyɔ. Mɛ̃ bvool ekieel esia mpaa. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn, ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel ã̀siɛɛn k'obvuul o mɛ̃, m'ãbuɛɛn ã byɛ y'owuaal b'ewuaal Ɔ̃fel a Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ebekiaal ãmfuru-mva bvool ndi ye kaã wɛn, mɛ̃ k'èbɔɔ opfuru me ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ. Kɛn a meba, wuo ãlio mbueel, mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã lam wɛn, lweel e Mãsia èmɔɔn me mɛ̃, ekal m'omwiĩ, ekal m'epfu e mɛ̃. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me b'otal mɛ̃, elaã eli Mãsia, epfu eli bvel. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Kɛn a ŋɛn mɛ̃ nkoo k'ekal mwiĩ me nsie ŋã, mɛ̃ nkoo k'esa kwɛn ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ aburu nsia. Kɛn onse oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ ki esuaal mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Adzuru mɛ̃ ngwel-a-ngwel: Mɛ̃ nzii k'esiil ɔ̃kiri bvool eyekal ye Mãsia, ke ngwel wɛ oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru obvie! <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Kɛn a me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ndɔɔ yi enduru ɔ̃bvɛn yi ekal mɛ̃ kɛn me nsie ŋã! <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã olɔ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃ kɛn èkal mwiĩ bvool èkal ye byɛ bueel, kwɛn byɛ ekwel bvool ekal y'esɛ onse okiool. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Obobɔ, ŋ'ekieel eyebvool mɛ̃ ola byɛ, byɛ ekal y'obɛɛl o ntwel me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ onse bvoo a byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Oŋɔ̃ edzuu m'emfa ki etam Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mãsia. Obobɔ, okɛɛn mɛ̃ ngyi byɛ otal, wuo ŋɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi ye byɛ wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyoo ndiri byɛ esɛn ãnã m'ãtsam ngãmɔ̃, bvool ebedzwaan bvoo onse ɔ̃fel ngɔmɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékiool byɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Ebee ataal a byɛ obal si ekal me ndɔɔ yam ke mã. Me ndɔɔ a bɔ, okyɛ eli eliĩ ki odziɔɔn o bɔ. Kɛn a me ndɔɔ a byɛ, okyɛ eli eliĩ ki obvuul o byɛ, b'ofi ola Nziã. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me b'otal Mãsia, Nziã k'asio byɛ nyiĩ kɛn a me ndɔɔ yi ekiool ndɛ wɛ, eli hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi emwɛn fool me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Meba ŋã, byɛ ebedzwaan mvel yiyi yi émwɛn byɛ ola mɛ̃, yɛn meba ŋã, byɛ ebeyoo ndiri mɛ̃ kɛn ebedzwaan yɔ.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okuaal o nzuru o Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Okɛɛn bvoo a byɛ ye Mãsia awa byɛ mpɛn, okɛɛn dzii e ndɛ ewɛɛl byɛ, okɛɛn byɛ eli bvoo ye ndɛ m'Ɔ̃fel, okɛɛn byɛ eli ye dzii bvool ye nyiĩ a bakyɛ, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />oŋɔ̃, esa kwɛn mɛ̃ nduul m'esɛ ŋ'ekal byɛ y'ɔ̃dzi, dzii lili, ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃ bvool ãtsam ngãmɔ̃. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ebee ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ osa y'ongoo, wuo me ndɔɔ yi ebii dzuun li ngwel-a-ngwel. Kɛn eyɔɔl okuaal o nzuru osa kwɛn byɛ ewal bakyɛ onge b'anduru byam. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse byɛ abee obvɛ o ndyam obii, abii hɛ̃ bo bakyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Ekal y'ãtsam m'éli a Yeso Mãsia onse byam:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Ndɛ wu áli ndyam onge Nziã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:6">kɛn a ndɛ k'ádzuul k'akal nsiil ye Nziã wɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Kɛn a me ndyam, ndɛ oyɔɔl bvieel bvi éli a ndɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">me ndɔɔ yi akal ndyam onge ɔ̃nkyal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:43-45">Mak 10.43-45</ref></char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">me ndɔɔ yi akal onge baal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">bvool baal amwɛn ndɛ kɛn onge mbuul.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Ndɛ okueel nzuru me ndyam ŋ'esuo ndɛ lweel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">tiil k'epfu, onkyam epfu li m'enkulusu.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Nziã bu andɛɛl ndɛ ke mboo yi enduru ãmboo mbueel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:9">bu awi ndɛ nkuun yi eli ke ywel ãnkuun mbueel.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />M'emfa okyɛ, me nkuũ a Yeso, bvieel ebva ãbuo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:10">ekal ke ywel, ekal me nsie bvool ekal ke nsɛn a nsie.<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />M'emfa okyɛ bvool, ɛ̃nywã mvieel ɛ̃yɛɛn wɛn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:11">Yeso Mãsia oli Mfam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:11">me ndɔɔ a lweel e Nziã wu Taal.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ongal onge ambunda onse ɔ̃kiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Obobɔ, andoo a dzii, onge b'ebelweel byɛ mɛ̃ tal lam lueel, ke kɛn a me lio li ndi mɛ̃ ye byɛ wɛ, ekal meba me lio lɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi ye byɛ wɛ, esuo lweel li enduru, esal me ndɔɔ obvuul o byɛ, ye bvɛ y'etiɔɔl. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã wu asal onse byɛ kwɛn byɛ ekal y'efwa bvool ekoo k'esa ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ m'edzii ndɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Esa ãndɔɔ mbueel ɛ̃nduɔɔl pyɛ, ɛ̃tsuun hɛ̃ pyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />Obobɔ, byɛ eywɛn elyal bvool ekal ankinkyam, baan a Nziã b'aywɛn a ndɔɔ yi awa mbyel onse baal b'ámaadziɔɔn bvool b'abi-abi. Onse baal obɔ, byɛ ebekaan onge ambunda onse ɔ̃kiri, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ebiri Endɔɔ li elaã. Oyɔ èkal ndɔɔ yi ekieel ebɔɔ mɛ̃ dzuun me tsoo li èya Mãsia, lɛn mɛ̃ k'étsuu ntiin yi ngwel wɛ, k'ési ɔ̃sal hɛ̃ wa ngwel wɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Onkyam ŋɛn ebvaan ãkel a mɛ̃ ãtsɔɔn onge mpɔɔ yi ebvɔɔn ye yi ewa byɛ Nziã y'ɔ̃sal wu okiool o byɛ, mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ me ndɔɔ oyɔ, bvool mɛ̃ esia mpaa ye byɛ bueel. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Byɛ hɛ̃, ekal y'esɛ bvool esia mpaa ye mɛ̃!<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool oyuɔɔl Timote y'Epafolodite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã onse Mfam Yeso wɛn mɛ̃ èyuɔɔl byɛ Timote tswa-a-tswa, kwɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nkal ye mpɛn ŋ'èbɔɔ mɛ̃ ãnsia ã byɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ke ndi ye mbuul ɔ̃kyam, wu oli ãtsam ngãmɔ̃ ye mɛ̃ bvool akɛɛ nguo taa-taa me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bam bueel abebii kɛn obvɛ o bam, ke bo Yeso Mãsia wɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Kɛn a byam eyɛɛ emfa ki ésuo Timote eliĩ ki ɔ̃sal a ndɛ, ŋ'éwi ndɛ ɔ̃tsiin a ndɛ m'otsal o Nsia yi Ngesɛ ye mɛ̃, onge muaan tsotsoo a tal. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã wɛn mɛ̃ èyuɔɔl byɛ ndɛ tswa-a-tswa, ŋ'èmwɛn mɛ̃ ngesɛ emfa ki esɛn ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Mɛ̃ bvool nkiool bam onse Mfam wɛn myam hɛ̃ èya alili ŋã. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ mwɛn ngesɛ k'ebveel byɛ Epafolodite wu ndoo a mɛ̃, ndoo a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃sal, ndoo a mɛ̃ wu eta, ntam wu éyuɔɔl byɛ mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yi abiri mɛ̃ bvi éli a mɛ̃ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ oli y'efua bibi ki amwɛn byɛ bueel bvool. Esi ndɛ bvool mpal me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyoo ndiri ndɛ ali y'ãluu. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Ke yam, ndɛ ali y'ãluu bvool akaasɔɔ okwa. Kɛn a Nziã osio ndɛ nyiĩ, ke kɛn a ndɛ wɛ, ye mɛ̃ hɛ̃, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbee ãnyiĩ ãnyiĩ okal. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl byɛ ndɛ tswa-a-tswa, kwɛn byɛ esia mpaa ŋ'èmwɛn byɛ ndɛ bvool, kwɛn me mbee y'ãnyiĩ bibi okal. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Oŋɔ̃ eyɔɔ ndɛ y'esɛ kieel onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mfam. Ekal ye bvɛɛ e baal ba m'emfa okyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ okaakwa me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal a Mãsia. Ndɛ owi omwiĩ o ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi awa mɛ̃ wuaal lɛn byɛ ale k'ekoo k'ewa mɛ̃ wɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Emfa ki taa-taa ki akal dzu ke mviil ã Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />K'osɛɛl, andoo a mɛ̃, esia mpaa onse Mfam. Mɛ̃ k'ewɔɔl m'okel o byɛ ãndɔɔ mãmã wɛ. Me ndɔɔ a byɛ, obobɔ enduru obvie. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Ekal y'onkyab me baal b'abi, ekal y'onkyab m'asal b'abi, ekal y'onkyab me baal b'aywɛɛn byɛ k'etsiil nzuru bo mfya! <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ke yam, b'ali y'otsiil o nzuru bo taa-taa eli bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ, b'ebebuɛɛn Nziã m'Ɔ̃fel a ndɛ, b'ebɛɛl ntwel me Yeso Mãsia, bvool bɛn k'ebeta kaã m'ombuul wɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Mɛ̃ mpii ále mbuul wɛn kɛn ekeeta kaã hɛ̃ m'ombuul. Okɛɛn eli ye mbuul wu atsam ndiri ndɛ okoo k'ata kaã m'ombuul, mɛ̃ wu ekeeta lɔ li enduru: <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Átsiil mɛ̃ nzuru me tsoo li mpuɔ̃ ke mbee a ŋ'áburu mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ ndi muaan a Isalayel wu emburu-ngoo, wa yam li Bɛnzamɛ̃. Ankiɔɔn a mɛ̃ áli Ayuda. Me b'otal okiaal o Ngel, mɛ̃ éli ɔ̃falisaye. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Me ndɔɔ ebal ki ɔ̃sal, mɛ̃ wu étueel Ebvɔɔn mpal. Me ndɔɔ emfa ki akal dzu m'olweel b'ãngel, mɛ̃ eywɛn elyal. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Kɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ m'ã́li y'ɔ̃bvɛn me mɛ̃, mɛ̃ bvool ke bengwal mɔ̃ y'ɔ̃bvɛn wɛ, me ndɔɔ a Mãsia. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Onkyam ãndɔɔ mbueel, mɛ̃ ebewal mɔ̃ onge ãndɔɔ mɛn otsɛn pyɛ, me ndɔɔ obvɛ b'onduru okuun. Obvɛ obɔ oli oyɛɛ o Yeso Mãsia wu Mfam a mɛ̃. Me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, mɛ̃ nkiool k'eyɔɔl ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel, mɛ̃ bvool ebewal mɔ̃ mbueel onge nsɔɔl, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbɔɔ Mãsia, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />bvool kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal me bvoo ye ndɛ. Ke mɛ̃ ekal dzu me myam m'olweel o Ngel wɛ, m'okal dzu me nkuul a okiool me Mãsia. Okal dzu obɔ, b'ofa ola Nziã me nkuul a okiool. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Ki nzii mɛ̃, k'eyɛɛ mɛ̃ Mãsia ye waan li osiool o ndɛ, k'esam mɛ̃ onse fool e ndɛ, bvool k'ekal mɛ̃ onge ndɛ onse epfu e ndɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Mɛ̃ ndi ye kaã kwɛn mɛ̃ èsiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, okɛɛn ekoo k'ekal obobɔɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsuu o ntiin tiil ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Ke mɛ̃ eyɛɛn wɛn mɛ̃ ŋ'emebɔɔ ebvakab wɛ, wuo wɛn mɛ̃ ŋe ngyii ɔ̃koo wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ebetsuu ntiin me ndɔɔ yi esa mpɛn yi ebɔɔ kyɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ hɛ̃ Yeso Mãsia ámaabɔɔ mɛ̃. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Andoo a mɛ̃, me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'etsam wɛn mɛ̃ ŋ'emeebɔɔ ebvakab wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ebesa ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ yi: Mɛ̃ ebedzɛɛn ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãli ke mbee a mɛ̃, bvool mɛ̃ ebewɛɛl mpɛn me mã ke nkwel. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Mɛ̃ ebetsuu ntiin tiil ntɔ, me ndɔɔ yi ebɔ ebvakab ki éti Nziã mɛ̃ mbel fa ywel me ndɔɔ a kyɛ, onse bvoo ye Mãsia. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ bueel b'emeekwel onse okiool, ekal y'ãtsam omɔ̃. Okɛɛn me ndɔɔ ngamɔ bubu, byɛ etsam emfa ekyam, Nziã àyɛɛl byɛ yɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Kɛn a ke mboo yi emeetɔ bia-byɛ, edzuu nkuul mɔ̃. <verse eid="PHP 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Andoo a mɛ̃, byɛ bueel esa onge mɛ̃, bvool etal baal b'abenɔɔn a kuul e bee. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bibi abedzuu onse otaal b'enkulusu e Mãsia. Nsa bibi mɛ̃ émeyɛɛn byɛ yɔ, meba ŋã mɛ̃ bvool ngyɛɛn byɛ yɔ y'elel kieel. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Bɔ àyesiɛɛn k'odziɔɔn, ke ngwel wɛ nziã wa bɔ, eli mwiĩ a bɔ. Bɔ abelɔ dzuun e bɔ m'ãndɔɔ m'ãwa bɔ opfuru, bvool bɔ abetsam kɛn a m'ãndɔɔ mã nsie. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Me b'otal bia-byɛ, bviil li bia-byɛ eli ke ywel, ku efa Mfam Yeso Mãsia wu Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ wu ebekiaal bia-byɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Ndɛ akieel aswɛɛl nzuru a bia-byɛ yɛn otsɛn pyɛ me ndɔɔ yi asuul yɔ onge nzuru a ndɛ yi dzuun, me waan li eli a ndɛ li asuul eluɔ bvieel ke nsɛn a okwɛn o ndɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Andoo a mɛ̃ adzii, obɔ otsɛn bɛn, byɛ bɛn mɛ̃ nzii bam k'emwɛn bvool, byɛ b'eli esɛ e mɛ̃ bvool eli dzuun e mɛ̃, etɛɛn ye mpɛn onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mfam.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãluo m'emfa bwɛn emfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Mɛ̃ ewa Ebvodi ye Sɛ̃ntiswe luo li akal ãtsam ngãmɔ̃ onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mfam. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Yɛ hɛ̃ wu ndoo a mɛ̃ wa taa-taa wu ɔ̃sal, mɛ̃ nsɔɔ ola yɛ k'awuaal a akaal obɔ. Bɔ b'adzwaan mboo mɔ̃ ye mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ, emfa ngemɔ̃ onge Kelemã y'andoo a mɛ̃ b'ɔ̃sal bakyɛ, bɛn ãkuũ ãli onse ɔ̃nkaan wu elaã. <verse eid="PHP 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Esia mpaa onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mfam lio lueel. Mɛ̃ bvool ngyɛɛn wɛn esia mpaa! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Yɔɔl kwɛn baal bueel ayɛɛ ɔ̃kwal a byɛ wu efyɛ! Mfam oyii tsotsoo. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ebee nguo okɛɛ me ndɔɔ mbi pyɛ, kɛn a m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, ewa ãkɔɔ ã byɛ ola Nziã, m'ãbuɛɛn, m'oluɔɔn y'obveel b'ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Obobɔ, opi o Nziã b'onduru ãyal mbueel, òkiaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ y'ãtsam ã byɛ onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="PHP 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Andoo, k'osɛɛl, yɔɔl kwɛn ãtsam ã byɛ ãkal nkal ãndɔɔ mbueel mã taa-taa, ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãwa dzuun, ãndɔɔ mbueel mã dzu, ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãywɛn a mbiin, ãndɔɔ mbueel m'edzii baal, ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ekiool baal, m'ãbvɛ-ãbvɛ bvool ye m'etuɛɛn baal. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Ãndɔɔ m'éyio byɛ, m'ébɔɔ byɛ, m'éyoo byɛ ye m'émwɛn byɛ ola mɛ̃, esa mɔ̃. Obobɔ, Nziã-nga-opi àkal ye byɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool obveel Ebvɔɔn li Filipese ãtuɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Mɛ̃ ensia-mpaa ngamfɛn onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Mfam, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ bvool esuo mɛ̃ wɛn byɛ ebetsam me mɛ̃. Ãtsam omɔ̃, byɛ éli ye mɔ̃, kɛn a byɛ éywɛn a mpwee yi esuo mɛ̃ mɔ̃. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Mɛ̃ k'eyɛɛn obobɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ nkaan ke m'emã wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ndyam éyio k'ebekal y'esɛ me ki ndi a mɛ̃. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ k'ebekal onse okaan, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyɛɛ k'ebekal onse obɔɔ bibi. Onse ãndɔɔ mbueel bvool k'ãmboo mbueel, mɛ̃ éyio k'ebekal onse yool wuo k'ebekwa a nzal, k'ebekal onse obɔɔ wuo k'ebekal onse okaan. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Mɛ̃ nkoo ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel me ndɛ wu abewa mɛ̃ mpɛn. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Kɛn a byɛ esi ngesɛ ŋ'ewueel a byɛ mɛ̃ onse ãwua ã mɛ̃. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Afi-Filipese, byam eyɛɛ kwɛn ŋ'ébɛɛn mɛ̃ Nsia yi Ngesɛ otee me lio li émbal mɛ̃ nsie yi Maseduaan, Ebvɔɔn si ngemɔ̃ li éwueel a mɛ̃ k'éli wɛ, b'áwueel a mɛ̃ m'ãkab m'akewa mɛ̃ ye m'ekewa mɛ̃ baal, kɛn a byɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'éli mɛ̃ ke bviil li Tesalonik, byɛ éyuɔɔl mɛ̃ bvi éli mɛ̃ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ nsa yuaal. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ke me ndɔɔ yɛn wɛn mɛ̃ ebii ãkab wɛ, ki ebii mɛ̃ kyɛn byɛ ebɔɔ bvel li bibi. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Mɛ̃ eyɔɔ eluɔ bvieel, mɛ̃ ndi y'obɔɔ bibi. Mɛ̃ nduul m'esɛ ŋe ngyɔɔ mɛ̃ eluɔ bvi eyi y'Epafolodite, bvi efi ola byɛ. Bvɛ eli onge ãnasi mã nswel ngesɛ, kab li ekiool Nziã, bvool li ewa ndɛ esɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Nziã a mɛ̃ àwa byɛ eluɔ bvieel bvi eli byɛ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ, m'emfa ki opfel o lweel e ndɛ onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Yɔɔl kwɛn alweel Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ɔ̃bu nzal ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃lɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Ebio ba ngel bueel onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia. Andoo b'ali ye mɛ̃ kwɛn abio byɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Ba ngel bueel abio byɛ, bvel-bvel b'ali ke nzɔ a Tsedzaal. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Yɔɔl kwɛn nyiĩ a Mfam Yeso Mãsia ekal y'ɛ̃fel ɛ̃ byɛ!<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>